# Keeps the build context (everything sent to the Docker daemon before a
# single instruction runs) small and reproducible - none of this should
# influence the image, and bin/obj/node_modules in particular are large
# enough to make every `docker build` slow if included.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.angular/
quotes-ui/dist/
day1/QuotesApi/wwwroot/*
!day1/QuotesApi/wwwroot/.gitkeep
day1/QuotesApi/App_Data/
day1/QuotesApi/quotes.db
day1/QuotesApi/infra-terraform/.terraform/
day1/QuotesApi/infra-terraform/terraform.tfstate*
**/*.user
.git/
.vscode/
.idea/
